Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD review-completion confirmation so clean patch agents
 close only after user approval

Prompt the reviewed patch-agent chat after a clean review so the user explicitly confirms whether the feature is done. A positive answer hides the patch-agent row without resuming the backend, while a negative answer or later typed text reopens the chat and continues the normal send path.
