+When an automatic review reports no findings, the controller appends a feature-completion prompt to
+the reviewed patch-agent session and selects that session. `WorkLeafController` treats `yes` or `y`
+as a close confirmation, records `work-leaf: feature marked done`, and keeps later text from being
